@startuml
title A scheduled pause takes effect one delay later, whatever transfers were proved
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
}

start
:t0: pause role calls pause();
:schedule_value_change(true)
timestamp_of_change = t0 + D;
note right
  Public. Anyone can read
  the deadline t0 + D.
end note
fork
  :Transfer proved before t0
  read paused = false
  expiration = anchor + D (<= t0 + D);<<#EEF5FF>>
fork again
  :Transfer proved after t0
  read paused = false (pending change)
  expiration = t0 + D exactly;<<#EEF5FF>>
end fork
if (block timestamp < t0 + D ?) then (yes)
  :Included. Transfers keep settling.;<<#FDEEEE>>
else (no)
  :Expired, or read paused = true
  and failed in simulation.;
endif
:t0 + D: first block where the flag is true.
Pause window = D, for any D.;
stop
@enduml
